msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"I heard the Gelateria Kamuro on Taihei Boulevard's pretty popular with "
"office workers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Hmm... I guess office workers get tired, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Where'd that come from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "When you're tired, that's when you get cravings for sweets, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "That... might be true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"The gelato there is so good. Plus they open late, just in time for someone "
"to stop by. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"There's some famous actor, Noboru Kudarizaka? I hear he sometimes visits "
"Sushi Gin on Showa Street, incognito."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Huh. Really? I like Noboru Kudarizaka, but he has a girlfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Nobody knows who it is, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "It's not like I want to date him, so it's just, like, whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"I heard that the kimchi over at Kanrai is made with real peppers from "
"Korea. It's healthy, cause of... cap-something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Capsaicin? People do say it's good for you. Apparently Korea is full of "
"gorgeous women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "I go to Kanrai sometimes since it's tasty, but I can't eat kimchi every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "I heard the ramen at Kyushu No. 1 Star on Pink Street is full of collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Really? I eat a lot of ramen, but I've never been to Kyushu No. 1 Star."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "It's pretty good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"I don't like going out to eat alone. And I can't just walk into an alleyway "
"ramen joint by myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Still, if you're the one recommending it... Maybe I'll ask a friend to go "
"with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"You know about the Yoshida Batting Center? Apparently pro baseball players "
"visit it sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Really!? I don't know the rules of baseball very well, but I watch games at "
"the stadium like all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "You don't know the rules?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Nope. But I do have a uniform! I watched games all the time in high school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll go check out Yoshida Batting Center sometime. I might just spot "
"a star. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Have you heard about the Matcha Fair at Café Alps over on Nakamichi Street?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Oh, I heard. They've got matcha parfaits, matcha chiffon cakes, all that "
"stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"But I dunno about these \"Japanese-inspired\" desserts. I like traditional "
"stuff like kudzu mochi, shiruko, or real matcha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Have you tried the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Braised pork burger? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Apparently it's popular with bloggers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "It got popular because of blogs? That's been happening a lot lately, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Wait, so you read blogs, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "No, I⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Do you seriously write your own blog!? Oh my god, I totally have to see it! "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"I heard you can make reservations for fancy handbags at Le Marche over on "
"Showa Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Oh. I do all my shopping online, though, so I don't need that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Online shopping's the best! It's just the most convenient way, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "You should try it, Kiryu-san. You can even shop from your phone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Do you know what Tantakatan is? It's a kind of shochu made from red "
"perilla..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Tantakatan? Yeah, I know it... What about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "It goes down easy, and pairs well with juices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"Huh. I'm curious now. I'll remember to try some next time. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"I heard they do great rafute soba at an Okinawan soba shop in Okinawa's "
"Kariyushi Arcade. It's delicious, and rich in collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Rafute? That's like braised pork belly, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"I think I saw something about that on TV. They said Okinawan rafute loses "
"its excess fat in cooking, so it's super healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Oh... You know a lot about this, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Heheheh. I pick up a lot of trivia, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about this the legendary snack at Aqua Sky? The bar in "
"Hatsumachi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Huh? Never heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Well, there's this legendary snack there... Any guesses what it is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "A legendary snack? Well, if it's Okinawa... something like tofuyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "It's salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Salt? What, like out of a shaker?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's a special salt that's only made in Okinawa. It's got a hint of "
"sweetness to it, too... Apparently enhances their drinks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Huh... Drinking with a side of salt? That actually sounds super classy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "You should try it sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "So, about Gelateria Kamuro..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"The one all the office workers go to? Yeah, I know. We talked about it "
"before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Did we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"I don't get to see you that often. Can't we talk about something more "
"interesting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "Have you been to Sushi Gin on Showa Street yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "Not yet. Honestly, I don't really care about Noboru Kudarizaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "You know? It's whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "About that kimchi at Kanrai..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid ""
"The one made with genuine Korean chili peppers, right? We already talked "
"about that stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Oh, I did?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "You forgot already? That's not cool, man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "I have, yeah. Gotta say, not an easy place for a girl to just walk into."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Yeah, point taken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"It was super yummy, though. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I could get hooked on "
"that ramen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Have you been by the Yoshida Batting Center?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid ""
"I went, but there weren't any pro players there... Figures I wouldn't run "
"into them that easily."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Yeah, probably not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Have you been to the Matcha Fair at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Oh... not yet. I was thinking I'd go later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Did you try the braised pork burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid ""
"Not yet. I've been too busy. But is it that big a deal? It's just pork in a "
"burger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "Well, you might have a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "About reservations at Le Marche..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid ""
"You asked me about that before. And I think I said I shop online... Don't "
"tell me you forgot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "No, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "You definitely forgot. Ugh. Unbelievable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Did you try Tantakatan yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I had some. It was really tasty when I mixed it with cranberry juice, "
"like a cocktail. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid "Heh. I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "Heheheh... I tried it with lots of stuff. It's so good in ginger ale, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"Next time... let's kick back and enjoy a fresh bottle\r\n"
"together. <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid "About that Okinawan rafute soba..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid ""
"After you brought it up, I got this crazy craving, so I went to the "
"Okinawan restaurant near my place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "Rafute is seriously yummy! But now... I want to go try rafute in Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "Have I mentioned there's a really popular snack⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid "Yeah, you did. Okinawan salt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid ""
"I can't get any around here, though. Next time you're in Okinawa, grab me "
"some."
msgstr ""

